// a view over a time travelling scan. A view body is stored as source text and re-parsed on use,
// so this exercises the grammar a second time rather than the AST that produced it. The view pins
// snapshot 1, so counting through it gives ids 1-800 => 800, not the latest 997
SELECT count(*) AS count FROM usersAtSnapshot;
